          "text": "```java\n/**\n * Test case for\n * <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/COMPRESS-351\">COMPRESS-351</a>.\n */\n@Test\npublic void testMessageWithCorruptFileName() throws Exception {\n    try (ZipArchiveInputStream zip = new ZipArchiveInputStream(\n            new FileInputStream(getFile(\"COMPRESS-351.zip\")))) {\n        try {\n            zip.getNextZipEntry();\n            fail(\"Expected ZipException for a corrupt entry name\");\n        } catch (final ZipException ex) {\n            assertTrue(\"Exception should identify the invalid entry name: \" + ex.getMessage(),\n                    ex.getMessage() != null\n                            && ex.getMessage().startsWith(\"Bad entry name: \"));\n        }\n    }\n}\n```"
